    "text": "BY VIRTUE of the powers vested in me by subsection (1) of section 8 of the Mediation (Special Categories of Disputes) Act,No. 21 of 2003, I, Thalatha Athukorale, Minister of Justice and Prison Reforms, do by this Order, specify for the purpose ofthe aforesaid section the monetary value of the subject matter of a dispute belonging to the category of disputes set out inColumn I of the Schedule arising wholly or partly within the Special Mediation Board Area specified in Column II of theScheudle shall be the amount specified in the corresponding entry in Column III thereof.",
